                  "text": "Deep-sea rigs and remote pipelines can't wait for satellites. When Colonial Pipeline shut down 45% of East Coast fuel because IT and OT weren't isolated, it proved one thing: centralized architecture is the real vulnerability. Build SCADA-like monitoring UIs that run 100% offline on local industrial PCs."
